cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Fringe in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Fringe: full-wave 2D optics simulator"
abstract: >-
  Fringe solves 2D optics scenes with full-wave electromagnetics (FDTD, FEM and
  MoM solvers for the out-of-plane field Ez) and renders the field. It is a Rust
  library with a C ABI, a command-line tool and a native macOS app with puzzles.
authors:
  - given-names: Alper
    family-names: Sarıtaş
version: 0.3.0
date-released: 2026-11-19
license:
  - MIT
  - Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/lprsrts/fringe"
url: "https://fringe.lprsrts.com"
keywords:
  - optics
  - electromagnetics
  - FDTD
  - finite element method
  - method of moments
  - photonics
  - simulation
  - education
